Tic-Tac-Toe feature implementation notes:

- All game logic is client-side only (no DB needed) per spec
- Pre-commit mypy hook checks only changed files with strict settings — test methods need type annotations (used Any for client fixture since conftest is untyped)
- Pre-commit trailing-whitespace hook auto-fixes files — be aware on first commit
- Playwright browsers need manual install in fresh codespaces: npx playwright install chromium
- React island pattern: mount function in index.tsx clears innerHTML before createRoot
- Do NOT import React in .tsx files — project uses react-jsx transform with noUnusedLocals:true
- data-testid=square on buttons is critical for E2E tests to avoid matching New Game button
- Score updates computed synchronously from nextSquares before setState (React batching)
- xStartsNext state tracks starting player alternation independently of xIsNext
